CM TM-WHP-NEC-001
CM 5.6m base-loaded vertical whip, 160m band (1.800-2.000 MHz)
CM ---------------------------------------------------------------
CM Antenna: 7-section telescopic whip, fully extended to 5.6m
CM Base loading coil: L=144.6uH, Q=250 at 1.900 MHz
CM   XL = 2*pi*1.9e6*144.6e-6 = 1725.0 ohms
CM   R_coil = XL/Q = 1725.0/250 = 6.90 ohms
CM Loading modeled as series RL: LD 0 type, segment 1 of GW1
CM
CM Wire geometry:
CM   GW 1: main whip, 40 segs, z=0.005 to z=5.605, radius=0.006m
CM   GW 2: radial +X, z=0.005, length=5.6m
CM   GW 3: radial -X, z=0.005, length=5.6m
CM   GW 4: radial +Y, z=0.005, length=5.6m
CM   GW 5: radial -Y, z=0.005, length=5.6m
CM
CM Ground: real average soil (GN 2), sigma=0.005 S/m, epsilon_r=13
CM Feed: voltage source EX 0 on segment 1 of GW1 (base of whip)
CM LD card: series R+jX placed at segment 1 of GW1 (loading coil)
CM
CM Expected results: ~50 ohm match with coil at resonance ~1.9 MHz
CM Radiation resistance typically 2-5 ohms; coil + ground losses dominant
CE
GW 1 40  0.0 0.0 0.005  0.0 0.0 5.605  0.006
GW 2 20  0.0 0.0 0.005  5.6 0.0 0.005  0.006
GW 3 20  0.0 0.0 0.005 -5.6 0.0 0.005  0.006
GW 4 20  0.0 0.0 0.005  0.0 5.6 0.005  0.006
GW 5 20  0.0 0.0 0.005  0.0 -5.6 0.005  0.006
GE 1
GN 2 0 0 0  13 0.005
LD 0 1 1 1  6.90 1725.0
EX 0 1 1 0  1 0
FR 0 9 0 0  1.800 0.025
RP 0 37 73 1000  0 0 5 5
EN
